tip: | Look at the rabbit. | Every pixel is on one ramp. With a silhouette this clear, the long ears do all the work.
tip: 1 | Ears make it. | Two tall lines on a round body, one step apart, so the sky shows between them.
tip: | Try it. | Erase the top of the ears and it turns into a mouse. One ramp keeps a sprite this small clean, so the shape has to do the work. | eraser
